title: "BOND-CLI: The Unified Terminal Front Door for the PROJECT BOND Suite"
abstract: >-
  The Layer-4 terminal front door (THE FRONT DOOR) of the PROJECT BOND suite:
  film brief/recon/plan/execute/debrief, orchestrator missions, suite status,
  and gadgets, delegating to the four built layers.
